#: docs/zh/explanation/implementation-map.md:31
msgid ""
"`xgl_protocol_io.h` 分别定义 packet TX/RX 和 frame TX/RX 四种单向端点。Transport 提供 packet RX，Network 提供 packet TX 与"
" frame RX，Datalink 提供 frame TX。实例静态绑定端点，packet TX 还提供对反向反馈出口的只读预检。各层通过有类型的端口交换同步借用数据。"
msgstr ""
"`xgl_protocol_io.h` defines four directional endpoints for packet and frame TX/RX. Transport provides "
"packet RX, Network provides packet TX and frame RX, and Datalink provides frame TX. The instance binds "
"them statically. Packet TX also provides a read-only check of the feedback egress. The typed endpoints "
"pass borrowed data synchronously."

#: docs/zh/explanation/implementation-map.md:33
msgid ""
"`xgl_packet.h` 包含借用的协议视图。`xgl_protocol_memory.h` "
"描述资源类别服务，不实现分配器；peer、等待确认记录、载荷与临时编码空间仍保持各自的容量和生命周期。不能仅因使用相同 allocator 接口就合并预算或引入共享堆回退。"
msgstr ""
"`xgl_packet.h` contains borrowed protocol views. `xgl_protocol_memory.h` describes resource-class "
"services without implementing an allocator. Peers, pending acknowledgements, payloads and encoding "
"scratch retain separate capacities and lifetimes. Sharing an allocator interface does not justify "
"merging their budgets or adding an implicit shared heap fallback."

#: docs/zh/explanation/implementation-map.md:35
msgid ""
"Datalink 源码按入口、发送、接收和 parser 划分。接收文件集中处理 span 消费、同步交付与 wire 错误分类；parser 只持有每 PHY 的增量状态。完整 wire view "
"位于同步调用栈，不为每条链路增加常驻 view。"
msgstr ""
"Datalink source separates initialization, transmit, receive and parser responsibilities. Receive owns "
"span consumption, synchronous delivery and wire error classification. The parser retains only per-PHY "
"incremental state. A complete wire view lives on the synchronous call stack, not persistently in every "
"link."

#: docs/zh/explanation/implementation-map.md:37
msgid "可靠队列保存并索引记录，不独立确认 scope，也不直接向 PHY 重发原始帧。由 peer 所有者 transport 经当前 network/security 路径执行这些状态转换。"
msgstr ""
"The reliable queue stores records and indexes them. It does not acknowledge scopes independently or "
"retransmit raw PHY frames. Peer-owned transport code performs these state transitions through the "
"current network/security path."

#: docs/zh/explanation/implementation-map.md:39
msgid "验证边界"
msgstr "Verification Boundaries"

#: docs/zh/explanation/implementation-map.md:41
msgid ""
"单元测试覆盖 ACK 校验、scope 隔离、取消、自有载荷生命周期与容量拒绝。Transport "
"属性测试经过生产重传路径。静态工作区属性测试在有界资源服务上验证容量边界和接收背压。Wire/security 测试断言字节布局、nonce/AAD 构造与重放行为。SDK/profile "
"冒烟构建独立于内部单元夹具，检查安装后的公开 API。"
msgstr ""
"Unit tests cover ACK validation, scope isolation, cancellation, owned payload lifetime and capacity "
"rejection. Transport properties exercise the production retry path. Static workspace properties use "
"bounded services across reliable delivery and receiver backpressure. Wire/security tests assert byte "
"layouts, nonce/AAD construction and replay behavior. SDK/profile smoke builds check the installed public"
" API separately from internal unit fixtures."
